{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckpool is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements, where you play as a rubber duck. Blast bizarre enemies with lasers and bubbles, dodge traps, fight bosses, and collect loot. Unlock unique ducks to uncover a hidden mystery. The game revives the brutal difficulty of classic arcade games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through <strong>nine maze-like maps (</strong>+1 secret or not<strong>)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over <strong>150 collectible ducks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold the story by collecting ducks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against  bizarre creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>soap loot</strong> and spend it on a slot machine or buy collectables directly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558150?t=1741359251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558150?t=1741359251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558150/257ee6ebbe964bfa635e493e384fc893aed07cef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741359251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558150/257ee6ebbe964bfa635e493e384fc893aed07cef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741359251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duckpool is a top-down shooter with roguelike elements, where you play as a rubber duck. Blast bizarre enemies with lasers and bubbles, dodge traps, fight bosses, and collect loot. Unlock